WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
CardioClarity: exploring coronary risk

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Decision support only. Not a diagnosis.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Dataset patient 20 is selected for demo.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Source and warning status stay visible.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Probability is not narrowing severity.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Rotate and zoom the schematic heart.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Select a vessel. Inspect its prediction.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Threshold differs from the colour midpoint.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:37.000
Read the returned reliability warning.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:52.000
Warnings qualify outputs; not diagnoses.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Why? shows signed point contributions.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:18.000
Points compare inputs with a reference.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:25.000
Not causal; the top-ten chart is a subset.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Review inputs, units and derived values.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:55.000
Structured data only; no image imports.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:08.000
Edits clear old results before requests.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:20.000
Fresh response from the real service.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:30.000
Sample truth does not apply to edits.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:43.000
Metrics are cross-validation estimates.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:55.000
Not external validation or clinical proof.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:04:08.000
React Three links to local FastAPI.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:20.000
Dataset and heart-mesh sources credited.
